erence, including her face, pale-blonde hair, clothing, body proportions, and overall character design.\n\nKeep her existing large sword as part of her character design.\n\nThe reference image defines Riven's appearance only.\nThe action and environment must follow the scene description below.\n\n\n=== TECHNICAL ===\n\nHigh-end live-action cinematic realistic dark fantasy.\n16:9 cinematic widescreen.\n\nNatural fast human running.\nRealistic body momentum.\nNatural hair and clothing movement.\n\nNormal cinematic speed.\nNo slow motion.\n\nNo dialogue.\nNo subtitles.\nNo text.\n\n\n=== SCENE ===\n\nOpen with a wide establishing view of a vast green valley surrounded by mountains.\n\nA dirt road crosses the valley and leads toward a distant forest.\n\nThe landscape is peaceful, open, and empty.\n\nThen cut to a close-up of boots running extremely fast along the dirt road.\n\nThe footsteps are fast and powerful.\n\nDust rises naturally from the ground with each step.\n\nThe camera follows the running feet.\n\nThen smoothly pull the camera back and reveal that the runner is Riven.\n\nRiven is running at full speed along the road through the valley.\n\nShe is traveling away from home and beginning her journey into the outside world.\n\nShe keeps running forward with youthful energy and determination.\n\nHer sword remains naturally carried with her as part of her normal character design.\n\nShe does not hold the sword in her hands.\n\nShe is not fighting.\nShe is not posing.\nNobody is chasing her.\n\nKeep the action focused on Riven running.\n\nFollow Riven as she runs along the dirt road across the open valley and toward the forest.\n\nThe camera occasionally widens enough to show Riven moving quickly through the large landscape.\n\nRiven reaches the forest and continues running along the path between the trees.\n\nShe does not stop or look back.\n\nEnd with Riven still running forward through the forest.\n\nCUT.\n\n\n=== MOOD ===\n\nEnergetic.\nFree.\nAdventurous.\nFor